cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HazelJS Agent OS, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HazelJS Agent OS"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Agent OS for TypeScript backends. Durable AI agents with DNA packages,
  Skillgate, Gatekeeper authorization, crash-safe HITL, and local apply inside the same
  DI/HTTP app as your APIs. Distinct from Builder Methods Agent OS, Agno AgentOS, and
  Framers AgentOS (agentos.sh).
authors:
  - name: "HazelJS Team"
    website: "https://hazeljs.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hazel-js/hazeljs"
url: "https://hazeljs.ai"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Agent OS
  - TypeScript
  - Node.js
  - durable agents
  - Skillgate
  - human-in-the-loop
  - HazelJS
